sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant PD as Processes Dashboard
    participant AM as Analytics Module
    participant API as Backend API
    participant PS as Process Service
    participant AS as Activity Service
    participant NS as Notification Service

    Note over U, PD: User accesses process monitoring
    U->>PD: Access processes dashboard
    PD->>API: GET /api/processes/metrics/overview
    API->>AM: Calculate performance KPIs
    AM->>PS: Query process execution data
    PS->>AM: Return execution statistics
    AM->>API: Return calculated metrics
    API->>PD: Performance data
    PD->>U: Display KPIs (127 processes, 84% success rate)
    
    Note over AM, PD: Real-time metrics updates
    AM->>AM: Calculate detailed performance metrics
    AM->>PD: Push metric updates every 30 seconds
    PD->>U: Update success rate (84% → 85%)
    PD->>U: Update avg execution time (2.7h → 2.6h)
    PD->>U: Update automation rate (78% → 79%)
    PD->>U: Update error rate (2.1% → 1.9%)
    
    Note over U, PD: User investigates performance trends
    U->>PD: Hover over success rate metric
    PD->>AM: GET /api/analytics/success-rate/trend
    AM->>PD: Return 7-day trend data
    PD->>U: Show trend tooltip (+3% improvement)
    
    U->>PD: Hover over execution time metric
    PD->>AM: GET /api/analytics/execution-time/trend
    AM->>PD: Return performance trend
    PD->>U: Show efficiency tooltip (-15% improvement)
    
    Note over U, PD: Process health monitoring
    PD->>PS: GET /api/processes/health-status
    PS->>AM: Analyze process performance
    AM->>PS: Return health scores
    PS->>PD: Health status for all processes
    PD->>U: Show process table with health indicators
    PD->>U: Highlight processes with low success rates
    
    Note over U, PD: Individual process performance review
    U->>PD: Click on "Weekly Newsletter Campaign" process
    PD->>PS: GET /api/processes/{id}/performance
    PS->>AM: Get detailed process metrics
    AM->>PS: Return process-specific data
    PS->>PD: Process performance data
    PD->>U: Show detailed process metrics modal
    PD->>U: Display usage count (23 uses)
    PD->>U: Display success rate (94%)
    PD->>U: Display average execution time (1.2h)
    
    Note over U, PD: Activity monitoring
    PD->>AS: GET /api/activity/recent
    AS->>PD: Return recent process activities
    PD->>U: Show activity feed
    PD->>U: Display "Process deployed: Content Creation Workflow"
    PD->>U: Display "Process updated: Social Media Automation"
    PD->>U: Display "Process completed: Email Campaign (Success)"
    
    Note over AM, NS: Performance threshold monitoring
    AM->>AM: Analyze process performance patterns
    AM->>AM: Detect success rate below 80%
    AM->>NS: Trigger performance alert
    NS->>U: Send notification "Process performance below threshold"
    NS->>PD: Show alert banner
    PD->>U: Display "1 process requires attention"
    
    Note over U, PD: Performance optimization workflow
    U->>PD: Click on alert banner
    PD->>AM: GET /api/analytics/underperforming-processes
    AM->>PD: Return processes below threshold
    PD->>U: Show performance review modal
    PD->>U: List "Blog Content Generation (75% success)"
    
    U->>PD: Click "Analyze Process"
    PD->>PS: GET /api/processes/{id}/failure-analysis
    PS->>AM: Analyze failure patterns
    AM->>PS: Return failure root causes
    PS->>PD: Failure analysis data
    PD->>U: Show failure breakdown
    PD->>U: Display "Integration timeouts: 60%"
    PD->>U: Display "Resource unavailable: 25%"
    PD->>U: Display "Configuration errors: 15%"
    
    Note over U, PD: Performance trend analysis
    U->>PD: View historical performance
    PD->>AM: GET /api/analytics/historical-trends
    AM->>PD: Return 30-day performance data
    PD->>U: Show performance charts
    PD->>U: Display success rate trend line
    PD->>U: Display execution time improvements
    PD->>U: Display automation rate growth
    
    Note over AM, PD: Automated performance reporting
    AM->>AM: Generate daily performance report
    AM->>AS: Log performance summary
    AS->>PD: Update dashboard metrics
    AM->>NS: Send performance digest to stakeholders
    NS->>U: Email daily performance summary
    
    Note over U, PD: Performance optimization actions
    U->>PD: Click "Optimize Processes"
    PD->>PS: GET /api/processes/optimization-suggestions
    PS->>AM: Analyze optimization opportunities
    AM->>PS: Return optimization recommendations
    PS->>PD: Optimization suggestions
    PD->>U: Show optimization modal
    PD->>U: Suggest "Increase timeout for integrations"
    PD->>U: Suggest "Add retry logic for failed API calls"
    PD->>U: Suggest "Enable parallel execution for independent tasks" 